<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>It is unlawful wilfully or knowingly, with intent to defraud, to sell or exchange, or offer or expose for sale or exchange, coal of a specific name or kind under any other name or description, or as the output of any mine other than the mine of which it is the product.</p></caml:Content>